{
  "technical_and_design_decisions": [
    "Target modules ported from Spring XD (U1-U5) will be refactored into Spring Cloud Stream standalone processor applications/components utilizing standard Spring Integration and Spring Cloud Stream annotations.",
    "The 'script' processor (U3) will leverage JSR-223 / Spring Integration Scripting support for dynamic evaluation (e.g., Groovy, JavaScript).",
    "The 'shell' processor (U4) will implement robust process execution management, handling standard input/output streaming, error redirection, and timeout configurations.",
    "The 'BinderFactory' abstraction (U8) will define a SPI and dynamic ApplicationContext loading mechanism allowing runtime selection and instantiation of multiple messaging binder types (e.g., Kafka, RabbitMQ) within a single application context.",
    "The exploration tasks for composed jobs (U6, U7) will be conducted as technical spikes resulting in architecture decision records (ADRs), resource cleanup strategies, and ZooKeeper metadata path/schema specifications."
  ],
  "assumptions": [
    "The developer has full access to both Spring XD and Spring Cloud Stream source repositories.",
    "Development and testing will be performed in a single-developer environment using JDK 17+ and standard Spring Boot test tools.",
    "Integration tests for binders and processor modules will rely on embedded messaging implementations or Testcontainers.",
    "Effort estimates represent pure development workdays (8 hours/day) excluding external review delays."
  ],
  "activities": [
    {
      "activity_id": "ACT-1",
      "activity_name": "Project Workspace & Dependency Setup",
      "activity_description": "Analyze existing Spring XD module implementations, set up local build environment, and establish module templates for spring-cloud-stream (s-c-s) processors.",
      "most_likely_effort": 1.0
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "ACT-2",
      "activity_name": "Port json-to-tuple Processor (U1)",
      "activity_description": "Port the json-to-tuple conversion logic from Spring XD to s-c-s, create auto-configuration properties, and add unit and integration tests.",
      "most_likely_effort": 1.5
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "ACT-3",
      "activity_name": "Port object-to-json Processor (U2)",
      "activity_description": "Port the object-to-json transformer module from Spring XD to s-c-s, implement message payload conversion, and provide test coverage.",
      "most_likely_effort": 1.5
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "ACT-4",
      "activity_name": "Port script Processor (U3)",
      "activity_description": "Port script processor module supporting dynamic script execution (Groovy/JSR-223) within s-c-s pipeline, including resource loading and unit/integration tests.",
      "most_likely_effort": 2.5
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "ACT-5",
      "activity_name": "Port shell Processor (U4)",
      "activity_description": "Port shell command execution module, handling external process invocation, argument passing, stream management, process timeouts, and tests.",
      "most_likely_effort": 2.5
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "ACT-6",
      "activity_name": "Port splitter Processor (U5)",
      "activity_description": "Port payload and expression-based splitter processor from Spring XD to s-c-s, including SpEL support and split collection streaming tests.",
      "most_likely_effort": 2.0
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "ACT-7",
      "activity_name": "Technical Spike: Composed Job Removal Options (U6)",
      "activity_description": "Investigate mechanisms in Spring XD to clean up unused memory footprints and resources associated with composed jobs; document recommendations and draft implementation options.",
      "most_likely_effort": 1.5
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "ACT-8",
      "activity_name": "Technical Spike: Composed Job Definition in ZK Metadata (U7)",
      "activity_description": "Explore strategies for persisting composed job definitions into ZooKeeper metadata store for state recovery during failure scenarios; construct POC and document schema/path structure.",
      "most_likely_effort": 2.0
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "ACT-9",
      "activity_name": "Implement BinderFactory Core Abstraction (U8)",
      "activity_description": "Design and implement the BinderFactory interface and default registry in Spring Cloud Stream to enable runtime dynamic creation and lookup of multiple binder types.",
      "most_likely_effort": 3.0
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "ACT-10",
      "activity_name": "BinderFactory Integration & Multi-Binder Testing (U8)",
      "activity_description": "Refactor context loading to utilize BinderFactory, add configuration handling for multi-binder setups, and implement end-to-end integration tests.",
      "most_likely_effort": 2.5
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "ACT-11",
      "activity_name": "Documentation, Build Integration & Final Verification",
      "activity_description": "Update project documentation, build scripts, configuration samples, and run full suite regression verification across all new modules and features.",
      "most_likely_effort": 1.5
    }
  ],
  "reported_total": {
    "most_likely_effort": 21.5
  }
}
```

